mafft-oxide is a Rust port of MAFFT. The port itself is distributed under
the BSD 3-Clause license in part 1. It is derived from MAFFT 7.526, so the
parts transliterated from MAFFT also remain under MAFFT's own copyright
notice, conditions and disclaimer, reproduced verbatim in part 2. Both
notices must be kept with any redistribution, in source or binary form.

